        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLHYD, Hyde Knob with Soleil Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe White Porcelain Hyde Knob with Soleil Rose shows off the craftsmanship that Grandeur is known for. An artful marriage of traditional and modern designs makes the Soleil Rosette with Hyde Knob a knobset for the ages. The Hyde Knob is made out of white porcelain while the Soleil Rosette is made out of solid brass and available in a wide array of complementing finish colors. The Hyde Knob with Soleil Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and will fit most standard predrilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLHYD Soleil Rosette with Hyde Porcelain Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hyde Knob with Soleil Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLHYD-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLHYD Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
